WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:11.660
Some people worried the Moon was covered in deep, fluffy dust that would swallow a spaceship. I was the test.

2
00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:16.850
I touched down gently on three legs… and didn't sink.

3
00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:22.500
My pictures told the Apollo engineers: it's safe to land.

4
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:26.000
I proved the Moon could hold you up.
